  "title": "Quick Vegetable and Chickpea Ratatouille",
  "blurb": "A speedy take on the Provençal classic with chickpeas for protein, simmered until the vegetables soften into a light sauce.",
  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat and cook the onions for 3 minutes until softened.",
    "Stir in the garlic and dried chilli and cook for 30 seconds.",
    "Add the aubergine, courgette and red pepper, then cook for 3 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Tip in the chopped tomatoes, chickpeas, tomato purée and oregano, then bring to a simmer.",
    "Cook for 5 minutes until the vegetables are tender and the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Season with salt and pepper, then serve warm."
  ],
